<LegalPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Estrato collects, uses, and protects information when you visit this site, sign up, or contact us."
  updated="October 2026"
>
  <p>
    This policy explains what information Estrato collects through this website, how we use it, and the choices you
    have. By using the site you agree to this policy.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you give us.</strong> When you join our email list or send an inquiry through the contact or distributor forms, we collect what you enter, such as your name, email address, company, phone number, and message.</li>
    <li><strong>Usage information.</strong> Like most websites, we and our service providers may collect technical information such as your browser, device, pages viewed, and approximate location, using cookies and similar technologies.</li>
    <li><strong>Order information.</strong> Purchases are not completed on this site. They are handled by Bottle Nexus and the licensed retailers in its network (see below).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To respond to your questions and inquiries.</li>
    <li>To send marketing emails you have signed up for. You can unsubscribe at any time using the link in any email.</li>
    <li>To understand how the site is used and to improve it.</li>
    <li>To protect the site and comply with the law.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Orders and Bottle Nexus</h2>
  <p>
    The cart and checkout on this site are provided by Bottle Nexus. Online orders are processed and fulfilled by
    licensed third-party retailers in the Bottle Nexus network, which collect the information needed to take payment,
    verify age, and deliver your order. That information is handled under the privacy policies of Bottle Nexus and the
    fulfilling retailer, not this one. You can read the
    <a href="https://bottlenexus.com/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bottle Nexus privacy policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Service providers</h2>
  <p>
    We use service providers to run the site and our communications, including Klaviyo for email sign-ups, forms, and
    email marketing, Elastic Email to deliver the messages you send us through our forms, Cloudflare (which hosts the
    site and provides spam protection through Turnstile), Clicky for website analytics, and Bottle Nexus for orders. They may process information on our behalf and only for those
    purposes. We do not sell your personal information.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    The site and its service providers use cookies and local storage to keep your cart, remember your preferences, and
    measure how the site is used. You can control cookies through your browser settings; some features, such as the
    cart, may not work without them.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can unsubscribe from marketing emails at any time. Depending on where you live, you may have the right to ask
    what personal information we hold about you, to correct or delete it, or to opt out of certain uses. To make a
    request, contact us through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> and we will respond as required by applicable law.
  </p>

  <h2>Age restriction</h2>
  <p>
    This site is intended for adults of legal drinking age. We do not knowingly collect information from anyone under
    21. If you believe a minor has given us information, contact us and we will delete it.
  </p>

  <h2>Security and retention</h2>
  <p>
    We use reasonable measures to protect your information, but no method of transmission or storage is completely
    secure. We keep information only as long as needed for the purposes described here or as the law requires.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it was last changed.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy? Reach us through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
</LegalPage>
